{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.poster.avif?t=1773316660\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.webm?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.mp4?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balltopia</strong> is a roguelike marble racing simulator where your only objective is to make more money. Featuring dozens of unique levels and over 50 game-altering cards, the potential to win is almost limitless - but be careful! Place an errant bet, and you could lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.poster.avif?t=1773316660\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.webm?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.mp4?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide your risk. </strong>Along the way,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you'll discover synergistic card combos and strategies. Some will allow you to play it safe, and others will require you to risk everything - with the potential to win even bigger. Is it worth the gamble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you aren't convinced, <strong>your viewers can join the fun</strong>. Balltopia features a versus Twitch chat mode that allows you to race against your followers and friends - you can even go fully AFK while it's running! Good times will be had by all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong> Hop on in and get the ball rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1773316660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1773316660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/4956e9022645cb964dc2762225c25cfabce9f02e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773316660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/4956e9022645cb964dc2762225c25cfabce9f02e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773316660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4239330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.poster.avif?t=1773316660\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.webm?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/b51f526438c115a5833490bd2721cfeb.mp4?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balltopia</strong> is a roguelike marble racing simulator where your only objective is to make more money. Featuring dozens of unique levels and over 50 game-altering cards, the potential to win is almost limitless - but be careful! Place an errant bet, and you could lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.poster.avif?t=1773316660\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.webm?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/extras/9fb343fdb3a8b69f1195430f8f9110c9.mp4?t=1773316660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide your risk. </strong>Along the way,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you'll discover synergistic card combos and strategies. Some will allow you to play it safe, and others will require you to risk everything - with the potential to win even bigger. Is it worth the gamble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you aren't convinced, <strong>your viewers can join the fun</strong>. Balltopia features a versus Twitch chat mode that allows you to race against your followers and friends - you can even go fully AFK while it's running! Good times will be had by all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong> Hop on in and get the ball rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SwinklyDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/7f785ab0593c634c07ac44ede7b5fa0ecad2de3e/header.jpg?t=1773316660","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/1295777994/748483bcf7d42494307aca6f6c12971696159a1f/1771717671/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771718286","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/1295777994/748483bcf7d42494307aca6f6c12971696159a1f/1771717671/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771718286","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003490/1295777994/748483bcf7d42494307aca6f6c12971696159a1f/1771717671/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771718286","id":257204282,"name":"Balltopia - Gameplay Short Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204282/586a66476a48b7e0df3f704272810c0bb0081e00/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771718286"}],"name":"Balltopia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SwinklyDev"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"